{"id":"e3128f6bf4e305c7","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-commutator-transitivity.md","title":"thm-commutator-monotonicity","display":"thm-commutator-monotonicity","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-commutator]]","[[93-df-congruence-modular]]"],"display":"thm-commutator-monotonicity","label":"93-thm-commutator-transitivity","aliases":["93-thm-commutator-transitivity"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18ca772ab524a46f\" href=\"?note=18ca772ab524a46f\" title=\"93-df-commutator\">93-df-commutator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8ff2f79b6a4018b\" href=\"?note=c8ff2f79b6a4018b\" title=\"93-df-congruence-modular\">93-df-congruence-modular</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-commutator-monotonicity"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-commutator-transitivity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-commutator-transitivity</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-commutator-transitivity-—-Commutator-Monotonicity-(legacy-label)\">thm-commutator-transitivity — Commutator Monotonicity (legacy label)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\theta&#39;,\\varphi,\\varphi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\theta,\\theta&#39;,\\varphi,\\varphi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\subseteq\\theta&#39;\">\\(\\theta\\subseteq\\theta&#39;\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\subseteq\\varphi&#39;\">\\(\\varphi\\subseteq\\varphi&#39;\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}commutator\\text{-}transitivity}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\to\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\theta,\\theta&#39;,\\varphi,\\varphi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\\\\n&amp;\\Bigl(\\theta\\subseteq\\theta&#39;\\land\\varphi\\subseteq\\varphi&#39;\n\\to[\\theta,\\varphi]_{\\mathbf A}\\subseteq[\\theta&#39;,\\varphi&#39;]_{\\mathbf A}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}commutator\\text{-}transitivity}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\to\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\theta,\\theta&#39;,\\varphi,\\varphi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\\\\n&amp;\\Bigl(\\theta\\subseteq\\theta&#39;\\land\\varphi\\subseteq\\varphi&#39;\n\\to[\\theta,\\varphi]_{\\mathbf A}\\subseteq[\\theta&#39;,\\varphi&#39;]_{\\mathbf A}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Binary commutators are monotone in both arguments. They are not generally associative, so <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\theta,[\\varphi,\\psi]]=[[\\theta,\\varphi],\\psi]\">\\([\\theta,[\\varphi,\\psi]]=[[\\theta,\\varphi],\\psi]\\)</span> cannot be asserted for every congruence-modular variety.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-commutator-transitivity-—-Commutator-Monotonicity-(legacy-label)","text":"thm-commutator-transitivity — Commutator Monotonicity (legacy label)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-commutator","status":"resolved","id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-commutator]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-modular","status":"resolved","id":"c8ff2f79b6a4018b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence-modular]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta,\\theta',\\varphi,\\varphi'\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\subseteq\\theta'","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\subseteq\\varphi'","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}commutator\\text{-}transitivity}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\to\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\theta,\\theta',\\varphi,\\varphi'\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\\\\n&\\Bigl(\\theta\\subseteq\\theta'\\land\\varphi\\subseteq\\varphi'\n\\to[\\theta,\\varphi]_{\\mathbf A}\\subseteq[\\theta',\\varphi']_{\\mathbf A}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"[\\theta,[\\varphi,\\psi]]=[[\\theta,\\varphi],\\psi]","display":false}],"bytes":1149,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["18ca772ab524a46f","c8ff2f79b6a4018b"]}